SUMMARY:Tatiana Eva Marie: Jazz in Paris
LOCATION:Birdland Theater\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Nicknamed \, "rdquo" -> the Gypsy-jazz Warbler" by the New York
 
 Times and acclaimed as a \, "rdquo" -> millennial shaking up the jazz scen
 
e" by magazine Vanity Fair\, Tatiana Eva-Marie is a transatlantic bandleade
 
r\, singer\, and actress based in Brooklyn. Though best known for her work 
 
leading the Avalon Jazz Band -- a band with a Parisian \, "rdquo" -> vintag
 
e" flair that has gathered over 70 million views on YouTube -- her interest
 
s have led her to explore a wide range of musical styles\, from 1930s pop t
 
o modern jazz. Tatiana Eva-Marie's singing is always inspired by her own Fr
 
ench and Balkan heritage\; a love for the Parisian art scene era spanning t
 
he 1920s to the 60s\; a passion for Gypsy music\; and a deep connection to 
 
the Great American Songbook. Through the lens of this musical kaleidoscope\
 
, she explores the music of Django Reinhardt\, Sidney Bechet\, Cole Porter\
 
, and other composers who were at the origins of French jazz\, while adding
 
 her own original lyrics and arrangements to the mix. Tickets & info: https
 
://www.ticketweb.com/event/tatiana-eva-marie-jazz-in-birdland-theater-ticke
 
ts/15007143
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/tatiana-eva-marie-jazz-in-birdland-thea
 
ter-tickets/15007143
