SUMMARY:Secrets in Stone
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>The Victorians were masters of secrets\, and they took plent
 
y of them to the grave! Across Green-Wood\, every carved flower\, weathered
 
 angel\, and mysterious emblem tells a story. On this crowd- favorite walki
 
ng tour\, you’ll become a detective of the dead\, decoding an elaborate l
 
anguage of symbols p Tickets & info: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/secrets-i
 
n-stone-tickets-1996638913739
